[{"id":168526311,"discussion_id":"b3cd842a40878966c1db8ea09bb6a8a99bbd7172","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-basic/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| image/grid_sample | ✅ [*张浩*](https://gitcode.com/demoauguste), [*zhajianqing123*](https://gitcode.com/zhajianqing123) (2/2) | ✅ [*张浩*](https://gitcode.com/demoauguste), [*zhajianqing123*](https://gitcode.com/zhajianqing123) (2/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n renruhai, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-04-16T15:47:17+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-17T16:39:39+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":168526432,"discussion_id":"8c0a6e692e91fa8b30434348d89bc6c03e9ed896","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n优化GridSample算子在特定硬件架构（Arch35）上的分片（tiling）策略。原策略仅依据输出张量大小和维度决定并行线程数和分片键，存在不足。当输入张量或网格张量数据量过大时，可能导致性能问题或计算错误。本次修改旨在通过综合考虑输入、输出和网格张量的数据量，确保选择正确的并行策略，提升算子在极端数据规模下的健壮性和性能。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n在GridSample算子的Arch35架构分片实现中，新增了用于存储输入张量和网格张量总元素数量的成员变量。在核心的分片决策函数中，扩展了原有的判断条件。原条件仅检查输出大小是否超过阈值或维度是否为0，现新增了对输入大小和网格大小的检查。当输入、输出或网格中任意一个数据量超过预设阈值时，系统将切换至更保守的3D并行策略，并据此计算分片键。此修改确保了在数据量过大时资源分配的合理性与计算的正确性。","created_at":"2026-04-16T15:47:53+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-16T15:47:53+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":168526620,"discussion_id":"9975abae5b5df2324ca5a18310de1f5994576306","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-04-16T15:48:55+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-16T15:48:55+08:00","user":{"id":"6822d30d60184036954b14e5","login":"renruhai","object_id":"6822d30d60184036954b14e5","name":"renruhai","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/renruhai"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":168526823,"discussion_id":"ba90cc629b18fb55a7e6b02aa602197c95433b01","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=5221dc81bdb145fdbd75243e550b8a32&pipelineRunId=c74c247a0929428b9dcec5b6c019af3e&projectName=CANN'>c74c247a0929428b9dcec5b6c019af3e</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链接</th></tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Compile_Ascend_X86</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=5221dc81bdb145fdbd75243e550b8a32&pipelineRunId=c74c247a0929428b9dcec5b6c019af3e&projectName=CANN>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/ops-cv/package/731/cann-ops-cv_linux-x86_64.run>